  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IMF technical assistance on tax issues</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IMF promotes revenue mobilization in support of sustainable development, and it provides
technical assistance for a select group of countries to achieve this. The expected outcomes are enhanced
revenue performance, improved tax policy design, high-quality tax legislations and regulations, more effective tax
administrations, more robust tax administration organizational structure, increased transparency, integrity, and
accountability of the tax systems.</narrative>
  </description>
